# Raw GPS exports carry location and time and are private (see docs/runbooks/gps-traces.md).
# Only sanitized *.trace.json fixtures are committed; raw files belong in .local/gps-traces/raw/.
# Bracket patterns match upper-case extensions on case-sensitive file systems too.
*.[gG][pP][xX]
*.[tT][cC][xX]
*.[fF][iI][tT]
*.[kK][mM][lL]
*.[kK][mM][zZ]
